    "detailed_description": "You've just received a letter that your home faces foreclosure within 7 days unless you come up with $1,000. Luckly for you, you've secure a job at Boo's Burgers during the graveyard shift. The generous owner, Boo, extends an offer for overtime, seeking your assistance with additional <i>chores</i>. However, you'll get more than you bargained for.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Nightshift</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/f2e9fedc0a30698ccf2d03d64772c3d2.poster.avif?t=1710903317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/f2e9fedc0a30698ccf2d03d64772c3d2.webm?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/f2e9fedc0a30698ccf2d03d64772c3d2.mp4?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With over 30 recipes there's plenty to learn at your new job! Assemble orders fast, but make sure to evade the danger that lurks in the restaurant.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage the Restaurant</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/2cdefe283c45addff04859b78ffba31d.poster.avif?t=1710903317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/2cdefe283c45addff04859b78ffba31d.webm?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/2cdefe283c45addff04859b78ffba31d.mp4?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Being the only employee comes with the privileged title of cook, manager, and warehouse associate! Using Boo Terminal OS\u00a9 access Boo's Overnight Delivery\u00a9 to order ingredients &amp; equipment as you need! You do have to venture into the warehouse which is shared by... <i>particular 3rd parties</i>. Fear not! We've managed to avoid any recordable injuries since last week's mishap.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Overtime</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/191961a3d109745ad51fef7fdb47afaf.poster.avif?t=1710903317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/191961a3d109745ad51fef7fdb47afaf.webm?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/191961a3d109745ad51fef7fdb47afaf.mp4?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Simple tasks undertaken for an extra buck swiftly entwine you in a web of conflict deeper than you could ever imagine. Who will you align yourself with?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 11 chapters<br></li><li> 20 achievements<br></li><li> Unique soundtrack</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You've just received a letter that your home faces foreclosure within 7 days unless you come up with $1,000. Luckly for you, you've secure a job at Boo's Burgers during the graveyard shift. The generous owner, Boo, extends an offer for overtime, seeking your assistance with additional <i>chores</i>. However, you'll get more than you bargained for.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Nightshift</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/f2e9fedc0a30698ccf2d03d64772c3d2.poster.avif?t=1710903317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/f2e9fedc0a30698ccf2d03d64772c3d2.webm?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/f2e9fedc0a30698ccf2d03d64772c3d2.mp4?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With over 30 recipes there's plenty to learn at your new job! Assemble orders fast, but make sure to evade the danger that lurks in the restaurant.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage the Restaurant</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/2cdefe283c45addff04859b78ffba31d.poster.avif?t=1710903317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/2cdefe283c45addff04859b78ffba31d.webm?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/2cdefe283c45addff04859b78ffba31d.mp4?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Being the only employee comes with the privileged title of cook, manager, and warehouse associate! Using Boo Terminal OS\u00a9 access Boo's Overnight Delivery\u00a9 to order ingredients &amp; equipment as you need! You do have to venture into the warehouse which is shared by... <i>particular 3rd parties</i>. Fear not! We've managed to avoid any recordable injuries since last week's mishap.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Overtime</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/191961a3d109745ad51fef7fdb47afaf.poster.avif?t=1710903317\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/191961a3d109745ad51fef7fdb47afaf.webm?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846990/extras/191961a3d109745ad51fef7fdb47afaf.mp4?t=1710903317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Simple tasks undertaken for an extra buck swiftly entwine you in a web of conflict deeper than you could ever imagine. Who will you align yourself with?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 11 chapters<br></li><li> 20 achievements<br></li><li> Unique soundtrack</li></ul>",
